	(text "I2C Map:\nIMU ICM-42605: 0x68 (AP_AD0 = GND), GPIO0/GPIO1 (I2C0)\nTemp LM75ADP: 0x48 (A2 A1 A0 = 0 0 0), GPIO2/GPIO3 (I2C1)\nHall TMAG5273A2: 0x35 (factory default), GPIO4/GPIO5 (I2C0)\nGPIO expander TCA9534: 0x21 (A2 A1 A0 = 0 0 0), GPIO22/GPIO23 (I2C1)\nColour VEML3328: 0x10, GPIO24/GPIO25 (I2C0)\nLED driver IS31FL3254: 0x30 (AD = 0), GPIO26/GPIO27 (I2C1)"
